# 10. Transition to the Next Deliverable

The completion of the Policy Pillar Assessments should allow the project to move from:

**What exists?**

to

**What works?**

to

**Where are the gaps?**

to

**What should change?**

The next stage should therefore be **Deliverable 5 — Conservation Performance Framework**.

That framework should establish the project's overarching method for measuring conservation success across very different ecological systems.

The central question will be:

> **How should the United States know whether its conservation system is actually conserving anything?**

That question should become one of the organizing principles of American Conservation Renewal.
